      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Quain are delighted to present this spacious 4 bedroom bungalow on a large private site with separate commercial premises to rear. \n\nThe residential property comprises a 4 bedroom 4 bathroom family home offering 212sq.m (2282sq.ft) of living accommodation to include entrance hall, sunroom, living room, kitchen, dining room, utility, two bathrooms, four bedrooms with two ensuite. The property occupies a mature private site with gardens front and rear and tarmac driveway. \n\nTo the rear there is a separate commercial premises measuring c.354sq.m (3810sq.ft), this previosuly operated as a bakery but is in need of complete refurbishment. The property occupies an overall site of \nc.1.33Acres.\n\nThis property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant. Eligibility for the Grant is subject to specific criteria and approval by the relevant local authority.VIEWING STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT THROUGH AGENT: SHERRY FITZGERALD QUAIN"
      },
